              </p>

              <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gar-text-primary mb-3">Protocol Overview</h4>
              <div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gar-text-secondary mb-4">
                <div>1. garlaunch spawns script with stdin/stdout pipes</div>
                <div>2. Script outputs JSON with items</div>
                <div>3. User selects an item</div>
                <div>4. garlaunch sends selection to script stdin</div>
                <div>5. Script outputs action (launch, close, switch, custom)</div>
              </div>

              <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gar-text-primary mb-3">Initial Items Message</h4>
